    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Me, Yo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eSports-grade online experience powered by a brand new <i>deterministic</i> multiplayer engine </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless experience designed to deliver stable, low-latency games across multiple platforms <br><br><strong><i>Or you can play offline verses AI!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/d912da0321d8fe1b8fc948342a8245f2.avif?t=1748895037\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Gardeners</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immerse yourself in the garden world, shrunk down to a more appropriate size for the adventure at-hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitively interact with the world around you, plant new things, spawn helpful bugs and creatures that will fight on your behalf</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and use your garden tools in a whole new way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pour your watering can to heal a flower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whack the mushroom monster with your shovel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat things up with a flame thrower when the battle gets out of hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a fully-functional squirt-gun with dynamic pump action! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However Your Garden Grows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant flowers, spawn critters, summon the elements; whatever you gotta do to destroy the enemy beehive while defending your own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice new strategies offline verses a bot in the same fast-paced gameplay</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controller Rollers<br><strong>This RTS <i>proudly </i>supports controllers (if you're not into the whole VR thing)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole separate experience in the exact same game, designed from the ground up with controller support in mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a more top-down view of your world to help you command your critters to victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/32309eacad1e3f31ee7be29ed21af91d.avif?t=1748895037\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Me, Yo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eSports-grade online experience powered by a brand new <i>deterministic</i> multiplayer engine </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless experience designed to deliver stable, low-latency games across multiple platforms <br><br><strong><i>Or you can play offline verses AI!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/d912da0321d8fe1b8fc948342a8245f2.avif?t=1748895037\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Gardeners</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immerse yourself in the garden world, shrunk down to a more appropriate size for the adventure at-hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitively interact with the world around you, plant new things, spawn helpful bugs and creatures that will fight on your behalf</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and use your garden tools in a whole new way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pour your watering can to heal a flower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whack the mushroom monster with your shovel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat things up with a flame thrower when the battle gets out of hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a fully-functional squirt-gun with dynamic pump action! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However Your Garden Grows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant flowers, spawn critters, summon the elements; whatever you gotta do to destroy the enemy beehive while defending your own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice new strategies offline verses a bot in the same fast-paced gameplay</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controller Rollers<br><strong>This RTS <i>proudly </i>supports controllers (if you're not into the whole VR thing)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole separate experience in the exact same game, designed from the ground up with controller support in mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a more top-down view of your world to help you command your critters to victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/32309eacad1e3f31ee7be29ed21af91d.avif?t=1748895037\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Defend your garden, online! GardenCraft is a simplified real time strategy game, designed so you don't realize you're playing a real time strategy game. Brought to you in state-of-the-art virtual reality, and including controller support for non-VR play.",
